{"unit_id":"tag:0EXZ:statement","translation":"设 <MATH_0001> 为余滤过的（cofiltered）指标范畴（index category），设 <MATH_0002> 为 <MATH_0003> 上位点（sites）的逆系（inverse system），如《位点（Sites）》情形 <REF_0001> 所述。置 <MATH_0004>，如《位点（Sites）》引理 <REF_0002> 和 <REF_0003> 所述。此外，假设给定\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> 阿贝尔层（abelian sheaf）<MATH_0005>，定义在 <MATH_0006> 上，对所有 <MATH_0007> 均如此，\n<STRUCT_0003> 对 <MATH_0008>，有映射（map）\n<MATH_0009>\n它在 <MATH_0010> 上的阿贝尔层（abelian sheaves）之间，\n<STRUCT_0004>\n使得 <MATH_0011> 只要 <MATH_0012> 就成立。则存在系（systems）的映射（map）\n<MATH_0013>\n使 <MATH_0014> 是单射的（injective），且 <MATH_0015> 为内射（injective）阿贝尔层（abelian sheaf）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"cofiltered","target_term":"余滤过的"},{"source_term":"index category","target_term":"指标范畴"},{"source_term":"sites","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"inverse system","target_term":"逆系"},{"source_term":"Sites","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"Sites","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"abelian sheaf","target_term":"阿贝尔层"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"abelian sheaves","target_term":"阿贝尔层"},{"source_term":"systems","target_term":"系"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"injective","target_term":"单射的"},{"source_term":"injective","target_term":"内射"},{"source_term":"abelian sheaf","target_term":"阿贝尔层"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"cofiltered","target_term":"余滤过的","context":"指标范畴"},{"source_term":"index category","target_term":"指标范畴","context":"逆系指标"},{"source_term":"sites","target_term":"位点","context":"逆系对象"},{"source_term":"inverse system","target_term":"逆系","context":"位点逆系"},{"source_term":"Sites","target_term":"位点","context":"引用章名"},{"source_term":"abelian sheaf","target_term":"阿贝尔层","context":"给定层和内射层"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射","context":"层和系的映射"},{"source_term":"abelian sheaves","target_term":"阿贝尔层","context":"转换映射的对象"},{"source_term":"systems","target_term":"系","context":"阿贝尔层系"},{"source_term":"injective","target_term":"单射的","context":"嵌入映射的单射