{"unit_id":"tag:0EXZ:proof","translation":"对每个 <MATH_0001>，选取单射（injection）<MATH_0002>，其中 <MATH_0003> 为 <MATH_0004> 上的内射（injective）阿贝尔层（abelian sheaf）。于是可考虑映射（maps）族（family）\n<MATH_0005>\n其中各分量的映射（maps）是伴随于（adjoint）映射（maps）<MATH_0006> 的映射（maps）。对 <MATH_0007>（在 <MATH_0008> 中），存在典范映射（canonical map）\n<MATH_0009>\n其分量（components）是典范的（canonical）映射（maps）\n<MATH_0010>\n对 <MATH_0011> 均如此。由此得到单射（injection）\n<MATH_0012>\n它在阿贝尔层（abelian sheaves）的系（systems）之间。注意，<MATH_0013> 是内射（injective）的阿贝尔群（abelian groups）层（sheaf），定义在 <MATH_0014> 上，见引理 <REF_0001> 和《同调（Homology）》引理 <REF_0002>。构造完成。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"injection","target_term":"单射"},{"source_term":"injective","target_term":"内射"},{"source_term":"abelian sheaf","target_term":"阿贝尔层"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"family","target_term":"族"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"adjoint","target_term":"伴随于"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"canonical map","target_term":"典范映射"},{"source_term":"components","target_term":"分量"},{"source_term":"canonical","target_term":"典范的"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"injection","target_term":"单射"},{"source_term":"abelian sheaves","target_term":"阿贝尔层"},{"source_term":"systems","target_term":"系"},{"source_term":"injective","target_term":"内射"},{"source_term":"abelian groups","target_term":"阿贝尔群"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"Homology","target_term":"同调"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"injection","target_term":"单射","context":"层与系的嵌入"},{"source_term":"injective","target_term":"内射","context":"内射层对象"},{"source_term":"abelian sheaf","target_term":"阿贝尔层","context":"各指标的内射层"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射","context":"层映射及分量转换映射"},{"source_term":"family","target_term":"族","context":"映射族"},{"source_term":"adjoint","target_term":"伴随于","context":"伴随映射"},{"source_term":"canonical map","target_