{"unit_id":"tag:09YP:proof","translation":"<MATH_0001> 的情形是《位点（Sites）》引理 <REF_0001>。\n\n<STRUCT_0001><STRUCT_0002>\n选取 <MATH_0002>，如引理 <REF_0002> 所述。完全按照引理 <REF_0003> 的证明论证，可见只需证明 <MATH_0003> 对 <MATH_0004> 成立。\n\n<STRUCT_0003><STRUCT_0004>\n置 <MATH_0005>。为证明 <MATH_0006> 的上同调（cohomology）在 <MATH_0007> 的每个对象（object）上消失，我们证明 <GROUPOPEN_0001><ACCENT_0001><GROUPCLOSE_0001>ech 上同调（cohomology），对 <MATH_0008> 以及任意覆盖（covering）<MATH_0009>（覆盖 <MATH_0010>），均为零（引理 <REF_0004>）。覆盖（covering）<MATH_0011> 来自覆盖（covering）<MATH_0012>，它覆盖 <MATH_0013>，对某个 <MATH_0014> 成立。有\n<MATH_0015>\n这是 <MATH_0016> 的情形。右侧在正次数（degrees）上无上同调（acyclic），因为它是无上同调（acyclic）的复形（complexes）的滤过余极限（filtered colimit），见引理 <REF_0005>。见《代数（Algebra）》引理 <REF_0006>。\n","allowed_english":["ech"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"Sites","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"cohomology","target_term":"上同调"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"cohomology","target_term":"上同调"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"degrees","target_term":"次数"},{"source_term":"acyclic","target_term":"无上同调"},{"source_term":"acyclic","target_term":"无上同调"},{"source_term":"complexes","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"filtered colimit","target_term":"滤过余极限"},{"source_term":"Algebra","target_term":"代数"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"Sites","target_term":"位点","context":"引用章名"},{"source_term":"cohomology","target_term":"上同调","context":"层上同调和 Čech 上同调"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象","context":"位点对象"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖","context":"位点覆盖"},{"source_term":"degrees","target_term":"次数","context":"上同调次数"},{"source_term":"acyclic","target_term":"无上同调","context":"复形的消失性质"},{"source_term":"complexes","target_term":"复形","context":"无上同调复形"},{"source_term":"filtered colimit","target_term":"滤过余极限","context":"复形的滤过余极限"},{"source_term":"Algebra","target_term":"代数","context":"引用章名"}],"notes":[